#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186105732 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186105590 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/id #uuid "957d070a-edc8-521f-a5bd-d10177a0bdbc" :question/math-academy-id "e-4344" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the triangle spanned by $\\mathbf{a}=\\langle 4,0,-3 \\rangle$ and $\\mathbf{b}=\\langle 5,-1,2 \\rangle.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 4 & 0 & -3 \\\\ 5 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}4 & -3 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ 5 & -1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(0\\cdot 2-(-3)\\cdot (-1))i-(4\\cdot 2-(-3)\\cdot 5)j+(4\\cdot (-1)-0\\cdot 5)k \\\\  & =-3i-23j-4k \\\\  & =⟨-3,-23,-4⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,a\\times b\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-3)^{2}+(-23)^{2}+(-4)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{554}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of the triangle is\n\n$$\nA_{\\triangle} = \\dfrac{1}{2}A = \\dfrac{\\sqrt{554}}{2}.\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049132} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186051021}] :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186533117 :question-generator/id #uuid "d0f2ae4b-20de-50a4-9979-aef1bd1d5273" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186105732.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186106120 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2513eb07-16be-5286-bc33-d8aa8c46c1cd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{273}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285112} {:answer/id #uuid "66423ab8-fae7-5127-a7c3-1cdcd20b4cdf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{285}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285714} {:answer/id #uuid "6eb9250a-2aa6-5790-8265-790a777b83b3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{825}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285813} {:answer/id #uuid "d4231ebb-ea19-5c2a-a034-0b7b57f48b39" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{177}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286716} {:answer/id #uuid "d4b9c672-c12b-55d0-930a-778da5483675" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{582}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286720}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "66423ab8-fae7-5127-a7c3-1cdcd20b4cdf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{285}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285714} :answer-field/id #uuid "ac35f525-4afb-57b4-9fa8-5e8beb00c4c3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287501}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "9432694c-4fbd-5497-812b-7bbf4e4f27ac" :question/math-academy-id "q-19983" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the triangle spanned by $a=⟨1,3,2⟩$ and $b=⟨4,1,-2⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 4 & -2\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(3\\cdot (-2)-1\\cdot 2)i-(1\\cdot (-2)-4\\cdot 2)j+(1\\cdot 1-4\\cdot 3)k \\\\  & =-8i+10j-11k \\\\  & =⟨-8,10,-11⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,a\\times b\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-8)^{2}+{10}^{2}+(-11)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{285}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of the triangle is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{\\sqrt{285}}{2}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186106121 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8ac7131d-bfd4-5f3e-bab3-45391fafe62f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186102603} {:answer/id #uuid "b7e95b0b-62a1-5619-b9ab-2516eedd3655" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186102604} {:answer/id #uuid "c37bf917-2973-5eae-ac60-dce80a07a630" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186102605} {:answer/id #uuid "c93f0b80-d4cf-5996-b664-2fe92fe080b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186102606} {:answer/id #uuid "50747cd8-e107-55b8-bc9e-602c96d71358" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186102607}] :answer-field/id #uuid "89c92172-1d2c-5b8b-affa-31d099647b03" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186102602}] :question/id #uuid "38aabf32-76e6-58d5-9143-a45f8b36d698" :question/math-academy-id "q-20003" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $a = ⟨ - 2,-3,-1⟩$ and $b = ⟨1, 2, 1⟩$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287886 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6f5744ef-1b8e-5152-8f6b-6c58808e05e2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285821} {:answer/id #uuid "75a1e7cc-e3a2-51b8-bca9-b3b300d0756f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285880} {:answer/id #uuid "a39acd59-c1ec-51d0-a69d-f4370d5bdf1f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286288} {:answer/id #uuid "ac05f264-0ba2-5898-bdea-abf6a84471dd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286361} {:answer/id #uuid "dd89447a-889f-5b9e-92e0-00cf6cf24813" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\sqrt{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286804}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a39acd59-c1ec-51d0-a69d-f4370d5bdf1f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286288} :answer-field/id #uuid "6af7f554-1c70-5cd5-8470-5c00835248b5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287372}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "8ddbfd2e-178a-532d-aeb2-81eedf1fe8dc" :question/math-academy-id "q-18580" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the triangle spanned by $r=⟨1,-2,3⟩$ and $t=⟨0,1,-2⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\times t & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =((-2)\\cdot (-2)-3\\cdot 1)i-(1\\cdot (-2)-3\\cdot 0)j+(1\\cdot 1-(-2)\\cdot 0)k \\\\  & =i+2j+k \\\\  & =⟨1,2,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,r\\times t\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+{2}^{2}+{1}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of the triangle is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{2}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287968 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "31831168-454f-5baf-9173-586eba9d4624" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{14}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285238} {:answer/id #uuid "3b19523e-0825-5461-afc4-1afb51acc0f4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{14}}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285344} {:answer/id #uuid "6c0bab51-aa06-5633-ad7e-cad3a75b9f36" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{14}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285778} {:answer/id #uuid "77a22a7a-5f71-57a2-bca0-1e46be7780e8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285899} {:answer/id #uuid "c7c0d194-f09e-5a8c-aaff-63d2d1628464" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286617}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6c0bab51-aa06-5633-ad7e-cad3a75b9f36" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{14}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285778} :answer-field/id #uuid "35ae4963-3d48-5daa-bb09-fff5ace57f0f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287258}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "fa11bb3b-6421-5e71-90eb-d6514f51a379" :question/math-academy-id "q-19981" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $u=⟨2,1,-1⟩$ and $v=⟨1,2,0⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\times v & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(1\\cdot 0-2\\cdot (-1))i-(2\\cdot 0-1\\cdot (-1))j+(2\\cdot 2-1\\cdot 1)k \\\\  & =2i-j+3k \\\\  & =⟨2,-1,3⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,u\\times v\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+(-1)^{2}+{3}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{14}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287969 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "36790fe4-27d4-5430-88cf-40fdcbb1fe9b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285294} {:answer/id #uuid "b3f9e5eb-469c-55c5-8da6-311732c4b4a7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\sqrt{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286426} {:answer/id #uuid "ba27497f-dcbe-599e-afe6-02f759bdea5c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286485} {:answer/id #uuid "bda96f26-df0a-565b-8da0-e4190336d93e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286522} {:answer/id #uuid "dc8e723b-8aea-5162-a514-5d1ec48189fd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5\\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286796}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dc8e723b-8aea-5162-a514-5d1ec48189fd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5\\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286796} :answer-field/id #uuid "72125cc1-d961-5f15-b759-baf12f6c70d1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287386}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "6f2ce5a4-7f12-54b1-ab3b-420eb2d47dab" :question/math-academy-id "q-19997" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $f=⟨1,1,-2⟩$ and $g=⟨3,2,1⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f\\times g & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 2\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(1\\cdot 1-2\\cdot (-2))i-(1\\cdot 1-3\\cdot (-2))j+(1\\cdot 2-3\\cdot 1)k \\\\  & =5i-7j-k \\\\  & =⟨5,-7,-1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,f\\times g\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{5}^{2}+(-7)^{2}+(-1)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{75} \\\\  & =5\\sqrt{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186287970 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0ce73380-2abe-591b-a501-2fffb25e9869" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186284895} {:answer/id #uuid "1b175e13-968e-5ec8-9d17-0a77d893b075" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285027} {:answer/id #uuid "2e9105f8-f2d6-5c3f-9c60-b593e96c51d9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{7}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186285206} {:answer/id #uuid "ab82b635-2160-5ed5-a7f7-47c54a617da1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286354} {:answer/id #uuid "ace7fdea-5fb7-5fd8-aa32-30d01d52a4f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286368}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ace7fdea-5fb7-5fd8-aa32-30d01d52a4f2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186286368} :answer-field/id #uuid "b1b35598-0d81-58f5-9d4e-8b067b0830b7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186287516}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "9a99808d-9449-580d-ae70-e6aff48c1ff9" :question/math-academy-id "q-20004" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $h=⟨2,0,3⟩$ and $l=⟨4,1,3⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}h\\times l & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 2 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(0\\cdot 3-1\\cdot 3)i-(2\\cdot 3-4\\cdot 3)j+(2\\cdot 1-4\\cdot 0)k \\\\  & =-3i+6j+2k \\\\  & =⟨-3,6,2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,h\\times l\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-3)^{2}+{6}^{2}+{2}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{49} \\\\  & =7.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292813 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9ba6a314-9690-51f8-ac65-d87aa7adaabd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\sqrt{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291309}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9ba6a314-9690-51f8-ac65-d87aa7adaabd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\sqrt{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291309} :answer-field/id #uuid "de32afac-e614-53fa-b799-24f12769f89d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292428}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "fc161987-10e4-5ee6-a6c6-ed110201a1f8" :question/math-academy-id "q-275220" :question/problem "Calculate the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $a=⟨-4,-2,1⟩$ and $b=⟨0,-2,-1⟩.$\n\n$A=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -4 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}-4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}-4 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =((-2)\\cdot (-1)-(-2)\\cdot 1)i-((-4)\\cdot (-1)-0\\cdot 1)j+((-4)\\cdot (-2)-0\\cdot (-2))k \\\\  & =4i-4j+8k \\\\  & =⟨4,-4,8⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,a\\times b\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{4}^{2}+(-4)^{2}+{8}^{2}} \\\\  & =4\\sqrt{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292814 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ff2a44dc-fdc6-559d-9985-a9e6ce7b18ea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{21}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291722}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ff2a44dc-fdc6-559d-9985-a9e6ce7b18ea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{21}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291722} :answer-field/id #uuid "60989695-b200-54ed-9968-72677234d5ec" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292028}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "1c7348e7-1921-5e09-8018-775e68160619" :question/math-academy-id "q-275222" :question/problem "Calculate the area ${A}_{△}$ of the triangle spanned by $a=⟨-2,-1,0⟩$ and $b=⟨-4,2,-2⟩.$\n\n${A}_{△}=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 2 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 \\\\ -4 & -2\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}-2 & -1 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =((-1)\\cdot (-2)-2\\cdot 0)i-((-2)\\cdot (-2)-(-4)\\cdot 0)j+((-2)\\cdot 2-(-4)\\cdot (-1))k \\\\  & =2i-4j-8k \\\\  & =⟨2,-4,-8⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,a\\times b\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+(-4)^{2}+(-8)^{2}} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{21}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of the triangle is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{2\\sqrt{21}}{2}=\\sqrt{21}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297464 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8e27d4c6-c946-503d-ac45-3010dc21b71f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5\\sqrt{17}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186296023}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8e27d4c6-c946-503d-ac45-3010dc21b71f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5\\sqrt{17}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186296023} :answer-field/id #uuid "6c1cb17d-1226-50b5-8a55-fa9762362774" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186296861}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e9963779-43cf-5b65-8821-6ff0b678d8cf" :question/math-academy-id "q-316345" :question/problem "Calculate the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $a=⟨-3,5,0⟩$ and $b=⟨4,-1,2⟩.$\n\n$A=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -3 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 4 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}-3 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}-3 & 5 \\\\ 4 & -1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(5\\cdot 2-0\\cdot (-1))i-((-3)\\cdot 2-0\\cdot 4)j+((-3)\\cdot (-1)-5\\cdot 4)k \\\\  & =10i+6j-17k \\\\  & =⟨10,6,-17⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,a\\times b\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{10}^{2}+{6}^{2}+(-17)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{100+36+289} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{425} \\\\  & =5\\sqrt{17}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297465 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ed164a80-8e70-5398-881b-db2dc37213b2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186296523}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ed164a80-8e70-5398-881b-db2dc37213b2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186296523} :answer-field/id #uuid "fa7793f2-af09-5083-a758-5dedb4543d5e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297147}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "5b9773af-f53a-5ffd-bd89-0fdc3a8398e6" :question/math-academy-id "q-316350" :question/problem "Calculate the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $a=⟨1,0,0⟩$ and $b=⟨0,3,4⟩.$\n\n$A=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(0\\cdot 4-0\\cdot 3)i-(1\\cdot 4-0\\cdot 0)j+(1\\cdot 3-0\\cdot 0)k \\\\  & =0i-4j+3k \\\\  & =⟨0,-4,3⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,a\\times b\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{0}^{2}+(-4)^{2}+{3}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{0+16+9} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{25} \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186297466 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "62f41066-5228-5f44-a4bc-f9a7a9de4308" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{31}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186295832}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "62f41066-5228-5f44-a4bc-f9a7a9de4308" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{31}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186295832} :answer-field/id #uuid "809afc0c-e441-5baf-a7b0-01f0a22f4f33" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186296898}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "ed3e1530-1ab9-5085-9128-11a28820fcba" :question/math-academy-id "q-316355" :question/problem "Calculate the area ${A}_{△}$ of the triangle spanned by $p=⟨0,5,-1⟩$ and $q=⟨6,0,1⟩.$\n\n${A}_{△}=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p\\times q & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 0 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 6 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}5 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ 6 & 1\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}0 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 0\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(5\\cdot 1-(-1)\\cdot 0)i-(0\\cdot 1-(-1)\\cdot 6)j+(0\\cdot 0-5\\cdot 6)k \\\\  & =5i-6j-30k \\\\  & =⟨5,-6,-30⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,p\\times q\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{5}^{2}+(-6)^{2}+(-30)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{25+36+900} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{961} \\\\  & =31.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of the triangle is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{31}{2}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186533089 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b4b1fd0e-7c9a-5d70-bf10-5e02ccfe0ea8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{146}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533108}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b4b1fd0e-7c9a-5d70-bf10-5e02ccfe0ea8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{146}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533108} :answer-field/id #uuid "6728a9ae-96e5-56bc-8253-87e573add42c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533098}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "3f226a42-1c19-5b1b-9c9d-b7e534c60692" :question/problem "Calculate the area ${A}_{△}$ of the triangle spanned by $a=⟨4,-5,-3⟩$ and $b=⟨-1,1,-5⟩.$\n\n${A}_{△}=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 4 & -5 & -3 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-5 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -5\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}4 & -3 \\\\ -1 & -5\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}4 & -5 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =((-5)\\cdot (-5)-(-3)\\cdot 1)i-(4\\cdot (-5)-(-3)\\cdot (-1))j+(4\\cdot 1-(-5)\\cdot (-1))k \\\\  & =28i+23j-k \\\\  & =⟨28,23,-1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,a\\times b\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{28}^{2}+{23}^{2}+(-1)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{784+529+1} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1314} \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{146}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of the triangle is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{3\\sqrt{146}}{2}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186533101 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "75bd512d-925b-5abd-a73f-5e9f381c0b67" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{301}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533103}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "75bd512d-925b-5abd-a73f-5e9f381c0b67" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{301}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533103} :answer-field/id #uuid "4255caa3-50ba-54fa-82a8-74962672c0b3" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533091}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "6cf72a6b-7f5c-53ee-89c4-60c564528c1e" :question/problem "Calculate the area ${A}_{△}$ of the triangle spanned by $p=⟨-3,6,0⟩$ and $q=⟨4,3,-6⟩.$\n\n${A}_{△}=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p\\times q & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -3 & 6 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 3 & -6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}6 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -6\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}-3 & 0 \\\\ 4 & -6\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}-3 & 6 \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(6\\cdot (-6)-0\\cdot 3)i-((-3)\\cdot (-6)-0\\cdot 4)j+((-3)\\cdot 3-6\\cdot 4)k \\\\  & =-36i-18j-33k \\\\  & =⟨-36,-18,-33⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,p\\times q\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-36)^{2}+(-18)^{2}+(-33)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1296+324+1089} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2709} \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{301}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of the triangle is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{3\\sqrt{301}}{2}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186533107 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2940bc66-6dca-54fe-86c2-cce56dcbff76" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5\\sqrt{82}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533086} {:answer/id #uuid "41beb57f-56fd-5175-8fe2-8ca34d908f70" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "35\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533090} {:answer/id #uuid "475d93f6-73c1-5b0e-9699-aa6b252a3217" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{35\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533092} {:answer/id #uuid "628b5ec7-d093-5db0-8e50-e8d9010441b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{929}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533097} {:answer/id #uuid "699110fa-ecec-5d60-ac7c-16ebeb43f741" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{1921}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533099}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "475d93f6-73c1-5b0e-9699-aa6b252a3217" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{35\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533092} :answer-field/id #uuid "ed3fc811-9e82-50bd-a79a-fa353e5ebb51" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533115}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "b36fd647-10f7-545b-9943-caa2a786ad1f" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the triangle spanned by $r=⟨-5,4,5⟩$ and $t=⟨6,3,-2⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\times t & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -5 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 3 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}4 & 5 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}-5 & 5 \\\\ 6 & -2\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}-5 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 3\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(4\\cdot (-2)-5\\cdot 3)i-((-5)\\cdot (-2)-5\\cdot 6)j+((-5)\\cdot 3-4\\cdot 6)k \\\\  & =-23i+20j-39k \\\\  & =⟨-23,20,-39⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,r\\times t\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-23)^{2}+{20}^{2}+(-39)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{529+400+1521} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2450} \\\\  & =35\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of the triangle is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{35\\sqrt{2}}{2}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186533110 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1575b61f-0d1c-5124-8694-4ce1d0966252" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{458}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533084} {:answer/id #uuid "27f9744c-3a01-5ff5-9439-9186460a5e89" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{290}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533085} {:answer/id #uuid "ba733d9d-17fb-5df7-9b58-0ff02201db1d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{51}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533109} {:answer/id #uuid "d2e5300d-e4d3-52c5-8d88-acd7e3cd7237" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\sqrt{51}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533111} {:answer/id #uuid "e14281c3-d653-50ea-a363-495ce1738e9d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{170}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533114}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ba733d9d-17fb-5df7-9b58-0ff02201db1d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{51}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533109} :answer-field/id #uuid "3b6906a0-59cf-5f7c-95fc-dbca97580305" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533087}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "c17b2fe8-a547-5a52-92cd-f1dffb87eded" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the triangle spanned by $a=⟨-5,4,3⟩$ and $b=⟨1,-1,-4⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -5 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}4 & 3 \\\\ -1 & -4\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}-5 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -4\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}-5 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(4\\cdot (-4)-3\\cdot (-1))i-((-5)\\cdot (-4)-3\\cdot 1)j+((-5)\\cdot (-1)-4\\cdot 1)k \\\\  & =-13i-17j+k \\\\  & =⟨-13,-17,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,a\\times b\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-13)^{2}+(-17)^{2}+{1}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{169+289+1} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{459} \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{51}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of the triangle is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{3\\sqrt{51}}{2}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186533112 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "00a30d7b-fd93-58a8-906c-ad912d203351" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\sqrt{481}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533083} {:answer/id #uuid "4a1ab39c-d6e4-51f2-a2c5-8faab7623717" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\sqrt{10}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533093} {:answer/id #uuid "6b9a50b5-4356-52bb-81aa-a133a55de28b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{157}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533100} {:answer/id #uuid "6e9a793b-f22e-5723-88b6-d66d411d8277" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{481}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533102} {:answer/id #uuid "8a1be13f-d97b-5330-8103-6c74c8528d9a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{445}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533104}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6e9a793b-f22e-5723-88b6-d66d411d8277" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{481}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533102} :answer-field/id #uuid "3d522e0e-82a9-50f9-8765-35d53a2b0cfe" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533088}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "d4f09c3f-3240-516c-9c0f-7fc9fbf59517" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the triangle spanned by $r=⟨4,6,1⟩$ and $t=⟨2,6,-5⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\times t & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 4 & 6 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 6 & -5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 \\\\ 6 & -5\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}4 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 6\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(6\\cdot (-5)-1\\cdot 6)i-(4\\cdot (-5)-1\\cdot 2)j+(4\\cdot 6-6\\cdot 2)k \\\\  & =-36i+22j+12k \\\\  & =⟨-36,22,12⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,r\\times t\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-36)^{2}+{22}^{2}+{12}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1296+484+144} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1924} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{481}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of the triangle is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{2\\sqrt{481}}{2}=\\sqrt{481}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186533116 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f88dd688-449b-5a6d-8b91-78d00d0c932b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4cdff164-9c10-5307-b70c-2f04f4e1f669" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{35}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533094} {:answer/id #uuid "58acee81-163c-5d99-be85-835f8c840a02" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{10}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533095} {:answer/id #uuid "599f2164-d778-5b3f-958c-c13692e24761" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{34}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533096} {:answer/id #uuid "986ee716-53e1-5587-be39-666b7583b953" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\sqrt{35}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533105} {:answer/id #uuid "9b125b61-7430-5b72-b48d-059cde3e3973" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{26}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533106}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4cdff164-9c10-5307-b70c-2f04f4e1f669" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3\\sqrt{35}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533094} :answer-field/id #uuid "dc7e8718-61f5-5615-94c6-2b4a3db6804f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186533113}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "ff6ee37a-5df7-5240-8139-6d8ab72c6503" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the triangle spanned by $r=⟨5,-5,-4⟩$ and $t=⟨2,1,-1⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\times t & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 5 & -5 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-5 & -4 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}5 & -4 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}5 & -5 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =((-5)\\cdot (-1)-(-4)\\cdot 1)i-(5\\cdot (-1)-(-4)\\cdot 2)j+(5\\cdot 1-(-5)\\cdot 2)k \\\\  & =9i-3j+15k \\\\  & =⟨9,-3,15⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the corresponding parallelogram is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\,r\\times t\\,| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{9}^{2}+(-3)^{2}+{15}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{81+9+225} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{315} \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{35}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of the triangle is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{3\\sqrt{35}}{2}.\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Triangle Spanned by Two Vectors"}]}
